<div class="bg-black min-h-screen pb-12">
  <div class="pt-6 px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">

  <div class="mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-white text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Personal Finance Manager</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold mb-3">Documentation</p>
    <%= link_to "View on GitHub", "https://github.com/TheP4trik-tech/Portfolio-Manager", target: "_blank", class: "text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 text-sm font-semibold transition-all" %>
    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      Personal Finance Manager is a portfolio tracking tool that aggregates your broker data into a unified EUR dashboard.
      Connect your broker accounts, and we'll automatically sync your portfolio data and send you daily summaries.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Supported Brokers (I'm working for more)</h2>
    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3">
        <%= image_tag("etoro_logo.png", class: "w-8 h-8 object-contain") %>
        <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">eToro</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3">
        <%= image_tag("trading212_icon.png", class: "w-8 h-8 object-contain") %>
        <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Trading 212</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">Getting Started</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-5">
        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Step 1</p>
        <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-1">Add your API credentials</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Go to API Credentials and add your broker API key and ID. Your credentials are encrypted and never stored in plain text.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-5">
        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Step 2</p>
        <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-1">Wait for your first sync</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Your portfolio will be synced automatically within the hour. You'll receive an email if anything goes wrong.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-5">
        <p class="text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Step 3</p>
        <p class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mb-1">Track your portfolio</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">View your portfolio value over time on the dashboard. All values are converted to EUR automatically.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">How Portfolio Sync Works</h2>
    <div class="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/50 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Your portfolio is synced automatically every hour. During each sync, we fetch your latest portfolio data from all connected brokers, convert everything to EUR using live exchange rates, and save a snapshot.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        If a broker returns an error (like invalid credentials), we'll send you an email notification.
        Note that if one of your brokers fails to connect, your snapshots won't save as it would disrupt data chart, this will continue till you edit your invalid credentials
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        You'll also receive a daily summary email every midnight with your portfolio changes over the last 24 hours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</div>